"Make sure you configure your reactive datasource in your `application."
"properties` (although you don't have to in DEV\n"
"mode: if you don't, a dev service will be provided for you):"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Now, in your code, the only differences with a regular managed session "
"entity are:"
