"jackson`, Quarkus automatically\n"
"adds REST support for common Jakarta Data parameter types. This lets you "
"declare Jakarta Data types directly as\n"
"REST endpoint parameters, and they will be populated from HTTP query "
"parameters without any manual parsing."
msgstr ""

msgid "Supported parameter types"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The following Jakarta Data types are automatically mapped from query "
"parameters:"
msgstr ""

